  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the general public who may be unaware of or indifferent to the harmful racial stereotype it perpetuates. It specifically aims to elicit a reaction from individuals who might engage in or witness racially charged name-calling in high school settings, particularly those who may not recognize the dehumanizing implications of equating Black people with primates. The intended audience includes adolescents and young adults familiar with high school social dynamics, as well as adults who may recall or be aware of such experiences. The meme relies on the audience’s potential ignorance or normalization of anti-Black racism to amplify its hateful message, making it particularly effective in communities where such stereotypes are not critically examined or challenged.",
